[gd_resource type="Theme" load_steps=25 format=3]

; Vanta Eclipse UI theme — chunky mobile shapes on a researched dark palette.
;
; Type is Nunito (SIL OFL): 900 for display, 800 for anything pressable, 700
; for body. It replaced Cinzel, whose Roman-inscription caps were the single
; biggest source of the old "fantasy serif" read.
;
; Two rules hold the SHAPE together:
;   1. CHUNK is a large corner radius plus a thick bottom border in a darker
;      shade of the fill, reading as a pressable lip. Pressed states shrink
;      the lip and shift the content margin down, so the button sinks.
;   2. GLOW is a coloured shadow_color at a large shadow_size. StyleBoxFlat's
;      shadow is the only bloom available without a full-screen pass.
;
; The COLOUR follows four rules, and they are not taste — the first version of
; this theme broke all four and read as a mess:
;   1. ONE accent hue, used sparingly. Not five saturated accents at equal
;      weight. Everything else is a violet-tinted near-neutral ramp, so the
;      brand is carried as a TINT rather than as competing colour.
;   2. The accent must not duplicate a game-world colour. The rarity tiers
;      (198 Rare / 270 Epic / 43 Legendary / 347 Mythic), the world palettes
;      and the enemy glow_colors already occupy most of the wheel; UI accents
;      landing on them made a button look like an item rarity. The accent sits
;      at 308, the largest free gap — 38 from Epic, 39 from Mythic.
;   3. Desaturate for dark. Every game colour is 92-96% saturation, which
;      vibrates against dark surfaces; UI chrome stays well below that.
;   4. Contrast is measured, not eyeballed. Body text 15:1 on surface, dim
;      text 7:1, label on the accent button 7.4:1.
;
; Semantics deliberately REUSE the game's own colours rather than inventing
; more: the boss bar is elder-enemy orange (an association, not a collision),
; and the normal enemy bar is a rose desaturated 61 points below Mythic so a
; large dull fill can never be mistaken for a small vivid rarity label.

[ext_resource type="FontFile" path="res://fonts/nunito-latin-900-normal.woff2" id="1"]
[ext_resource type="FontFile" path="res://fonts/nunito-latin-800-normal.woff2" id="2"]
[ext_resource type="FontFile" path="res://fonts/nunito-latin-700-normal.woff2" id="3"]

